    <briefdescription>
<para>Allocator which defers allocations to the CUDA asynchronous memory allocations APIs (cudaMallocAsync, cudaFreeAsync) </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This can be used as an alternative in CUDA graphs to avoid creating CUDA graphs with a large memory footprints. Allocations will be done in the same stream as the one used to launch the graph, and will be destroyed in that stream when the graph has been launched. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
